---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <section class="cover-hero" aria-label="Photo of Lew">
    <img src="/images/working-at-bg.jpg" alt="Lew working on a laptop by the windows" />
  </section>

  <main class="page">
    <section class="home-intro">
      <p>
        lewsthoughts is a place for me post some of the slightly more develop thoughts and ideas that I think about. Some ideas are more fleshed out than others.
      </p>
      <p>
        I don’t really see myself as much of a writer, but I like to write my thoughts down to help me figure them out and explore them more…
      </p>
      <p>
        ... and sometimes they turn into articles.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
